{% doc %}
@param {object} customer - Shopify customer receiving the invite
@param {object} contact - Company member role and preference data
@param {object} company - Client company workspace data
@param {object} portal - Portal invite and onboarding state
@param {object} links - Signed links for account access and support
{% enddoc %}

{% assign locale = contact.locale | default: customer.metafields.app.client_portal.value.default_locale | default: 'en' %}
{% assign company_name = company.name | default: customer.name | default: 'your team' %}
{% assign portal_url = links.portal_url | default: portal.url %}

{% if locale == 'fr' %}
Bonjour {{ contact.name | default: customer.first_name | default: '!' | escape }},

Votre espace client Pasquin est pret pour {{ company_name | escape }}.

Vous pourrez y suivre les prochaines etapes, confirmer les acces Shopify, partager les assets, consulter les demandes, voir la feuille de temps publiee et garder un oeil sur les factures.

Prochaine etape: {{ portal.next_action | default: 'confirmer le brief de lancement' | escape }}.

Ouvrir votre espace:
{{ portal_url }}

Merci,
Philippe Pasquin
{% else %}
Hi {{ contact.name | default: customer.first_name | default: 'there' | escape }},

Your Pasquin client workspace is ready for {{ company_name | escape }}.

You can use it to track next steps, confirm Shopify access, share assets, review requests, see published timesheets, and keep billing clear.

Next step: {{ portal.next_action | default: 'confirm the kickoff brief' | escape }}.

Open your workspace:
{{ portal_url }}

Thanks,
Philippe Pasquin
{% endif %}
